[Playground in TS 4.4.3](https://www.typescriptlang.org/play?ts=4.4.3#code/PTAEBUAsEsGdQMYEMA2LQCMBOBTJBreaAOwgGVQAWAOgFZMdkBXWHUAWyZQBdoAHFG24BPPmwBuSLNCQZB8KW2IB7UCmXEA5jiyhYTPn2VZuOACYAuAFAAFLMvZwc1VCgA8sbtK0AaUMSZ2DB0APgAKAG0AIiQovwBGAF0ASiA) | [Playground in TS 4.5 Beta](https://www.typescriptlang.org/play?ts=4.5.0-beta#code/PTAEBUAsEsGdQMYEMA2LQCMBOBTJBreaAOwgGVQAWAOgFZMdkBXWHUAWyZQBdoAHFG24BPPmwBuSLNCQZB8KW2IB7UCmXEA5jiyhYTPn2VZuOACYAuAFAAFLMvZwc1VCgA8sbtK0AaUMSZ2DB0APgAKAG0AIiQovwBGAF0ASiA)

Given the low prevalence of those use cases, we can easily convert them to the new form:

